            "language" : "en",
            "original_language" : "en",
            "profile_photo_url" : "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJyGc42V5Ne_qbHP9Asx10qUu93si7Fsr4uoq7jmjm0k5lMJQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
            "rating" : 1,
            "relative_time_description" : "a month ago",
            "text" : "Horrible service very rude and was lacking in professionalism",
            "time" : 1792549710,
            "translated" : false
         },
         {
            "author_name" : "Rishu Pb13",
            "author_url" : "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110556719198024232963/reviews",
            "language" : "en",
            "original_language" : "en",
            "profile_photo_url" : "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKQcAeKqiire39Wz4w1a0k9ZbbVgqu2lC-dybgGYQ8mND01Na0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
            "rating" : 1,
            "relative_time_description" : "a month ago",
            "text" : "I ordered a Veggie Patty sub and asked the staff member to change her gloves before preparing my food. She initially refused, made faces, and said, “I didn’t touch anything.” However, she was preparing food for another customer before making mine, which made me uncomfortable.\n\nI also asked if my food could be packed separately, but she refused and said, “We can’t.”\n\nThe way I was treated and the lack of willingness to accommodate a simple request made this a very unpleasant experience. Definitely one of the worst experiences I’ve had at Subway. I hope the staff can be more respectful and considerate toward customers in the future.",
            "time" : 1790760891,
            "translated" : false
         },
         {
            "author_name" : "David Liyo",
            "author_url" : "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106047991761197745772/reviews",
            "language" : "en",
            "original_language" : "en",
            "profile_photo_url" : "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK49H_fMj4TJ72AtRzJZrDQm8czOwvzqJ4cZ6w2ClKE9yEVNQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
            "rating" : 1,
            "relative_time_description" : "2 months ago",
            "text" : "Hi Manager,\nI would like to make a complaint about one of your staff members, Viva. She behaved very rudely toward me and did not speak to me in a respectful or professional manner.\nI was also disappointed with the service. She put too much salad and sauce in my sub, which made it very messy and difficult to eat.\nPlease take this matter seriously and pay attention to the way she treats customers and prepares their food..\nThank you.",
            "time" : 1789646093,
            "translated" : false
         }
